// Samples the low 32 bits of the constant-frequency reference clock after the
// resident program's prior vector loads and stores complete. Release/acquire
// operations in the caller separately own visibility to the peer device.
// Message 0x83 is RTN_GET_REALTIME. Its returned SGPR is asynchronous and must
// be waited on through LGKM or KM, according to the selected instruction set.
template.decl @completed_tick() -> (i32)

// Full-width samples bound the resident interval in this same shader domain.
// Request records keep the compact low word; no DRM epoch identity is assumed.
template.decl @completed_tick64() -> (i64)
